      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your story is a powerful one, yet your situation is even harder for such a big loss.\nThe fire in the brazier is dying down, sending its remaining heat into the ashes.\nNot the shouting, but the silence after. The way the field went quiet once the screaming stopped. I led them there. I gave the order. All those men, gone because I couldn't see the trap.\nIt is not possible to wash this off.\nThere is no way to be whole again. I am a butcher now, and I cannot go back to being a commander.",
